ritize demands, and the ability to work in a team environment.","source_heading":"DESCRIPTION","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"The CNA participates in a collaborative team environment, including training and evaluation of peers, scheduling of work, and assisting the administrative functions of the unit. Will cross-train for the roles of Hospital Unit Secretary (HUSC) and Continuous Observation Attendant (COA). Regularly functions as a patient sitter and observes and monitors patients to ensure their well-being and safety.","source_heading":"DESCRIPTION","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"7 East is a 14-bed Medical-Surgical unit located at UC San Diego Health’s Hillcrest campus, near downtown San Diego. This secured unit provides specialized care for patients with both medical and behavioral health needs.","source_heading":"DESCRIPTION","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"qualification","requirement_level":"preferred","item_text":"Bilingual: Spanish/English.","source_heading":"PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Demonstrated ability to observe deviations from normal.","source_heading":"MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":"preferred","item_text":"Knowledge of Epic, UCSD Paging & Scheduling Systems.","source_heading":"PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Strong interpersonal and communication skills.","source_heading":"MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":"preferred","item_text":"Knowledge of medical terminology.","source_heading":"PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Ability to adapt to different work environments and patient populations.","source_heading":"MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS","source_subheading":null}],"pay":{"salary_min":26.53,"salary_max":35.03,"salary_period":"hour","annual_min":55182.4,"annual_max":72862.40000000001,"annual_comparison":64022.40000000001,"status":"usable","source":"scalar:hiring_pay_scale","source_heading":"hiring pay scale","source_text":"$26.53 - $35.03 / Hour","is_hourly_fte":true,"hours_per_unit":null},"published_at":"2026-09-29T15:32:22.830156+00:00"}
